<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-PSG DEFENDER N'GOTTY OUT FOR A MONTH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PSG DEFENDER N'GOTTY OUT FOR A MONTH.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>French international defender Bruno N'Gotty, injured in Paris St Germain's 2-0 league defeat by Monaco on Sunday, will be out of action for a month, the Parisian team said on Monday.</p>
<p>N'Gotty is to have an operation on his cheekbone on Tuesday.</p>
